<Base
  title={`Hot-Air Balloon over the Mara — 2-Day Escape | Rendile Travels`}
  description={`A 2-day escape built around a dawn hot-air balloon safari over the Maasai Mara, with a champagne bush breakfast and game drives. From $1,290, resident rates available.`}
  ogTitle={`Hot-Air Balloon over the Mara — 2-Day Escape | Rendile Travels`}
  ogDescription={`A dawn balloon over the Maasai Mara with a champagne bush breakfast. 2 days from $1,290.`}
  ogType={`website`}
  ogImage={`assets/img/kenya.jpg`}
  canonical={`https://rendiletravels.com/balloon-mara.html`}
  jsonld={`{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"TouristTrip","name":"Hot-Air Balloon over the Mara — 2-Day Escape","description":"A 2-day escape built around a dawn hot-air balloon safari over the Maasai Mara.","image":"https://rendiletravels.com/assets/img/kenya.jpg","provider":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Rendile Travels"},"offers":{"@type":"Offer","price":"1290","priceCurrency":"USD"}}`}
  credit={`Imagery via Wikimedia Commons: balloon © Svein-Magne Tunli, licensed under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0" target="_blank" rel="license noopener">CC BY-SA</a>.`}
>

<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero__media" style="background-image:url('assets/img/kenya.jpg')"></div>
    <div class="page-hero__scrim"></div>
    <div class="container page-hero__content">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light reveal">Off the beaten path · Itinerary</p>
      <h1 class="reveal">Hot-Air Balloon over the Mara</h1>
      <div class="itin-meta reveal">
        <span><b>2 days · 1 night</b></span>
        <span>Maasai Mara · Fly-in</span>
        <span>Resident rates available</span>
        <span>from <b>$1,290</b> / person</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__actions reveal" style="margin-top:1.6rem"><a href="contact.html?trip=Hot-Air%20Balloon%20over%20the%20Mara" class="btn btn--gold">Enquire about this escape</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="article reveal">
        <nav class="breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Home</a> / <a href="index.html#experiences">Off-beat escapes</a> / Hot-Air Balloon over the Mara</nav>
        <p class="article__lead">A bucket-list moment in a single overnight. Drift in silence over the Maasai Mara at first light, the plains and their herds unrolling beneath you, then touch down to a champagne breakfast laid out in the bush.</p>
        <p>The fastest, most romantic way to fall in love with the Mara — perfect for an anniversary, a birthday, or simply because it's the weekend.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Day by day</p><h2 class="section__title">Your escape</h2></div>
      <div class="days">
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 1</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Fly to the Mara</h3><p>A midday flight from Nairobi to a Mara airstrip, into camp for lunch, and an afternoon game drive in search of lions and elephants as the light softens.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Mara tented camp · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 2</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Dawn balloon &amp; fly home</h3><p>A pre-dawn start to lift off as the sun rises — an hour drifting over the plains, then a champagne bush breakfast on landing. A last game drive, and the midday flight home.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Meals:</b> Breakfast</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="incl reveal">
        <div class="section__head section__head--left"><p class="eyebrow">All taken care of</p><h2 class="section__title">What's included</h2></div>
        <ul class="incl__grid">
          <li>Return flights (Nairobi ⇄ Maasai Mara)</li>
          <li>One night at a tented camp</li>
          <li>Hot-air balloon safari &amp; champagne breakfast</li>
          <li>Game drives &amp; park fees</li>
          <li>All meals as shown</li>
          <li>Airstrip transfers</li>
          <li>24/7 Rendile concierge</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top:1.2rem;color:var(--ink-soft)">From <strong>$1,290 per person sharing</strong>; <strong>resident rates available</strong>. Balloon flights are weather-dependent (we rebook if grounded). Easily extended to a second night for more time on safari.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="container reveal"><h2>Rise over the Mara.</h2><p>Tell us your dates and we'll reserve your balloon and camp — resident rates included.</p><a href="contact.html?trip=Hot-Air%20Balloon%20over%20the%20Mara" class="btn btn--gold">Enquire about this escape</a></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">More escapes</p><h2 class="section__title">Other off-beat escapes</h2></div>
      <div class="related__grid reveal">
        <a class="feat" href="tuna-fishing-lamu.html"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/kenya-lamu.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Big-Game Fishing in Lamu</h3><p>3 days · The Majlis.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="kitesurfing-diani.html"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/diani-beach.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>Kitesurfing in Diani</h3><p>3 days · Galu Beach.</p></div></a>
        <a class="feat" href="index.html#experiences"><div class="feat__img" style="background-image:url('assets/img/camel-trek.jpg')"></div><div class="feat__body"><h3>All quick escapes</h3><p>Browse every off-beat experience.</p></div></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

